# A button menu: each item has its own button; East picks the second without moving.
setup tests/scenarios/packs/menus.padpack Menus
press north
advance 100
tap east 30
advance 100
release north
---
overlay menu "Buttons"               @0
sound menu Open pop                  @0
sound menu Pick pop                  @100
overlay menu "Buttons" selected "Eb" @100
overlay none                         @100
sound menu Close pop                 @100
key KEY_E down                       @100
key KEY_E up                         @100
